    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O'Connell Properties are delighted to bring to the market 20 Windmill Court, located in Dublin 15. A splendid 3 bedroom family home with a sunny balcony. The accommodation extends to c.108 sq. meters and comprises an entrance hall, Guest W/C, living room and open plan kitchen/dining room. The first floor has 2 double bedrooms, an En Suite, 1 single bedroom, and a family bathroom. The property has been lovingly maintained by its present owner and is presented in excellent condition throughout.\r\n\r\nThis is a much sought after development with an abundance of open space and many local amenities, recreational facilities and an excellent choice of national and secondary schools. The M50 Motorway is only 2 kms away and Dublin City Centre c.10kms. The Blanchardstown Shopping Center and Connolly Hospital are within close proximity and Dublin Airport is only a 10 minute drive.\r\n\r\nWhilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, and they are believed to be correct, they are not warranted and intended purchasers/lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information given."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\nLiving Room: 4.7m X 5m with wood floring and feature fireplace, double doors opening to the sunny balcony\r\n\r\nKitchen: 2.8m X 6.9m with tiled flooring and shaker style kitchen\r\n\r\nGuest W/C: 1.6m X 1.5m tiled floor with WC and WHB\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 4.6m X 3.6m Large double bedroom with wood flooring and fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nEn Suite: 3m X 1.5m with shower, WHB and WC\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 2.7m X 3.7m with wood flooring and fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 7m X 1.9m with wood flooring and fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.7m X 1.7m bath, WHB, and WC"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Mature residential area and great location close to shops, schools and transport linksBeautiful\r\nBER B\r\nc.2Km from Blanchardstown Shopping Centre and c.12km from Dublin City Centre\r\nVibrant community with many sporting and social clubs and facilities in the area\r\nBeautiful 3 Bedroom, 3 Bathroom duplex presented in immaculate condition\r\nAmple Parking\r\nGas heating"
      },
      {
